{"content":[{"c":["MEPHAATH"],"sourceClass":"h1","t":"p"},{"c":["One of the cities of Reuben’s tribe on the plain near Heshbon, which was allotted to the Merari family of Levites (",{"href":"?bref=Josh.13.18","r":"Josh.13.18","rawR":"Josh.13.18","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Josh.13.18","value":"Josh.13.18"}],"t":"ref","v":"Jos 13:18"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Josh.21.37","r":"Josh.21.37","rawR":"Josh.21.37","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Josh.21.37","value":"Josh.21.37"}],"t":"ref","v":"21:37"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.6.79","r":"1Chr.6.79","rawR":"1Chr.6.79","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.6.79","value":"1Chr.6.79"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 6:79"},"). Later, it was numbered among Moabite towns during Jeremiah’s ministry (",{"href":"?bref=Jer.48.21","r":"Jer.48.21","rawR":"Jer.48.21","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Jer.48.21","value":"Jer.48.21"}],"t":"ref","v":"Jer 48:21"},"). It has been identified with modern Jawah, six miles (9.7 kilometers) south of Ammon."],"sourceClass":"fl","t":"p"},{"c":[{"c":["See also"],"sourceClass":"ital","t":"span"}," ",{"href":"?item=LeviticalCities_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","id":"LeviticalCities_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","rawId":"LeviticalCities_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","t":"link","v":"Levitical Cities"},"."],"sourceClass":"","t":"p"}],"format":"bsb-study-dictionary-v2","id":"Mephaath","provenance":{"archiveSha256":"10758ea00dbea7540f9337e43e59c8e4000295c1261e3426bab6f31c31dcff5b","release":"1.6","sourceCitationReferences":[{"anchorText":"Jos 13:18","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Josh.13.18","rawQueryValue":"Josh.13.18","sourceRefExact":"Josh.13.18"},{"anchorText":"21:37","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Josh.21.37","rawQueryValue":"Josh.21.37","sourceRefExact":"Josh.21.37"},{"anchorText":"1 Chr 6:79","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Chr.6.79","rawQueryValue":"1Chr.6.79","sourceRefExact":"1Chr.